======================================================================================================================
A1.0  the point-mass charge function for g_tot = g_N (1 + f(x)),  x = r/r_M,  r_M = sqrt(G M/a)
======================================================================================================================
  general:  R(x) = f'(x)(1+f(x))/x = d[(1+f)^2]/d(x^2)
  sympy dsolve of R = 1:  [Eq(f(x), -sqrt(C1 + x**2) - 1), Eq(f(x), sqrt(C1 + x**2) - 1)]
  solutions: [-sqrt(C1 + x**2) - 1, sqrt(C1 + x**2) - 1]
  K1 (P2): f = sqrt(1+x^2)-1      -> R = 1
  K2/B1/B2 (Verlinde point mass): f = x -> R = (x + 1)/x
  K3 (simple wall): f = (sqrt(1+4x^2)-1)/2 -> R = 1 + 1/sqrt(4*x**2 + 1)
  B4 (total-mass reading, point mass): M_tot = M x, g_tot = a/x -> R = 1;  dark mass M(x-1) < 0 for x < 1; g_tot/g_N = x < 1 for x < 1

